window.products.push({"id":283060,"name":"Custom Elastic Edged Polyester Fitted Table Cover with Logo/Photo/Text/Image, Customized Fitted Square Table Cloths,Fit 40\"x40\" Square Table,for Buffe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KBm-Pe+QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please measure the size of your desk before you buy. This is very important. Our high-quality fabric fitted tablecloths with a wide variety of creative designs. We are always dedicated to creating new ideas within our product category. We are at the heart of every tablecloth to make your home interior nice and comfortable! Create a simple and relaxing setting on the table with our elegant design tablecloth and gather round to share a meal in the company of loved ones at home that’s warm and sweet.  Versatile Occasions We offers an array of parrern, sizes and colors to suit your table and to enhance any décor. Our delicate tablecloth is designed for a variety of happy occasions — suitable for your dining-room table, kitchen table, Cafes, restaurants, diners, catering, weddings, brunches, buffets, parties, picnics, outdoor patio table and more. Premium Collection We offers high-quality fabric tablecloths with a wide variety of creative designs. We are always dedicated to creating new ideas within our product category. This Elastic Edged Polyester Fitted Table Cover Design tablecloth are available in many vibrant colors and multiple-choice sizes for each season and occasion. Spill Proof This soft and durable tablecloth is made of premium polyester fabric with spill-proof treatment. All liquids bead up for easy cleaning. Also, it is wrinkle resistant and easy to maintain. EASY CARE When the tablecloth needs to be washed, you can throw them in the washing machine, and they’ll come out looking good as new. No loose threads, stubborn stains, or shrinkage. You can reuse it for years to come. Wash with cold water on gentle cycle and do not bleach. Tumble dry (Low)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KBm-Pe+QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lyzelre","source_asin":"B09JKY8Z3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JKY8Z3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JKY8Z3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
