window.products.push({"id":283156,"name":"Nvetls 1st Birthday Decorations for Girls and Boys Birthday Decorations Party Balloons Set Baby Girl and Baby Boy (Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WNvLLBHVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Information: Every baby is an angel and an important member of the family.  We were very excited and nervous when we first became a parent.  Until now our baby is one year old, we have experienced the most special time in our life.  And it’s the first birthday of our baby, whether for us or for baby, it is a very significant day.  This is a day for celebration and remembrance.  Our birthday decoration set has two colors, blue and pink. Whether you have a boy or a girl, it can meet your needs. How to use: Inflate: 1.First find the balloon seal, insert the nozzle into the seal 2-3cm, pinch the plastic paper against the nozzle, and slowly fill the air. 2.Do not fill the air inside the balloon too much, especially when used under high temperature conditions. After filling it, gently squeeze the seal with your fingers. Features: Material: latex, aluminum film and paper Dimension: 1 balloon: 76cm/30in Star-shaped balloon: 51cm/20in  Round balloon: 46cm/18inSmall balloon: 30cm/12in Length of letter banner: 2m/6.6ft and 2.5m/8.2ft Package list: 1 * 1 balloon 1 * happy birthday banner 2 * star-shaped balloons 2 * round balloons  5 * sequin balloons 5 * baby blue balloons  5 * mazarine balloons  1 * ribbon Notice: 1.Sharp objects, unclean ground, prolonged direct sunlight and excessively squeezing will damage or burst the balloon. 2.After filling with helium, the balloon can float for 6-14 hours, so inflate it on the day of use. (Pay attention when using helium) [About damage]: Due to the particularity of the balloon itself, we cannot test it one by one, please decorate in advance.  If there are any problem with the product, please contact customer service, we will give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WNvLLBHVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Petsoigné","source_asin":"B07MZZK2XW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MZZK2XW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MZZK2XW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
