window.products.push({"id":283219,"name":"Humidifiers for Large Room, 6.5L Humidifiers for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51leMsrIgqL._AC_SL1494_.jpg","description":"About Products: Output interface: DC24V Input interface:100-240V 50/60Hz 0.65A MAX Rated power:15.6W Product capacity: 6.5L Working time: 16-54Hrs Spray mode: strong(280ml/hr)/weak(180ml/hr)/intermittent(110ml/hr) Applicable water quality: distilled water/tap water Material quality: Environmentally friendly PP Color: White Use occasions: home, bedroom, large room, office, dorm room, apartment etc. The Use of Keys: 1.Plug the power on the back of the humidifier and turn it on.At this time,the power indicator lights up(about 0.1 seconds),indicating that the humidifier is already in power-on standby state. 2.Touch the “POWER”button to turn on the humidifiers,then the humidifier is in strong spray mode 3.Press the Power button again ,the weak spray mode starts 4.Keep touching the switch,Low atomization volume intermittent work indicator light on.The humidifier works for 20 seconds and stops for 10 seconds. Night light: In each working state of spray mode, long press the power button(1-2 seconds), the indicator light will be on, and the night light will be on; press again (1-2 seconds) and the night light will be turned off. Product lists: 1* Humidifier 1* Manual 1* Adapter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51leMsrIgqL._AC_SL1494_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BT1BTJ44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT1BTJ44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT1BTJ44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
