window.products.push({"id":283489,"name":"Porthos Home Parker Adjustable Chair with 360° Swivel, Roller Caster Wheels and Button Tufted PU Leather Upholstery","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nziBxe9cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get a classy colleague in the Porthos Home Parker adjustable office chair Don’t let the office grind get to you. At least get yourself seated comfortably in the Porthos Home Parker adjustable height office chair. Ergonomic height adjustable feature The Parker swivel chair office offers tremendous flexibility no matter which desk you’re sitting at. With one push of the lever, instantly adjust its height to complement the height of the desk so you don’t have to hunch over or strain your neck and shoulders. Yay to office ergonomics! Freedom of movement The adjustable height office chair is also about giving you total freedom of movement. Its 360° swivel lets you turn in every direction while its roller caster wheels lets you zip seamlessly across the room. You don’t have to get up from the swivel office desk chair if you don’t wish too actually! Gorgeous button tufted PU leather upholstery You’ll fall in love with the beautiful button tufted upholstery that adds amazing texture and visual interest to an otherwise plain-looking modern swivel office chair. Best thing is, the PU leather upholstery repels spills and drips, so you never have to worry about cleaning up ugly stains on the chair at all. Features of Porthos Home Parker adjustable ergonomic office chair: • Height adjustable gas lift seat adjustment• 360° swivel• Durable roller caster wheels• Water and stain resistant PU leather upholstery• Stylish button tufted design• Dimensions: (height) 30.31 - 34.65 x (width) 16.93 x (length/depth) 21.65 inches• Weight: 17 lbs• Simple assembly required 1-year warranty for your peace of mind The Porthos Home Parker adjustable office chairs come with 1-year warranty, so you can always call us if you need help with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nziBxe9cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Porthos Home","source_asin":"B06Y1YM56L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y1YM56L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y1YM56L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
