window.products.push({"id":283641,"name":"Shelf Liner - Heavy Duty Non-Slip, Non-Adhesive Shelf Liner - EVA Material, BPA Free, Waterproof, Oil-Proof - Easy to Clean, Wash, Care - Cut Into Dif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BnSU7+6AL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"HIGHEST QUALITY MATERIAL! The Shelf Liner material is of high-quality Ethylene Vinyl Acetate, BPA-free as well as odor free, so you are getting the best shelf liner on the market. This material is also eco-friendly, as it has great waterproof and anti-oil effect. All of our materials are non-adhesive; help reduce slipping and crowding in your drawers. EASY TO INSTALL AND CLEAN! Our shelf-liner can be easily cleaned and wiped off with a simple cloth and water! Because of the simple effort required to clean it makes it reusable as many times as possible. And also, these shelf liners can be moved and adjusted easily with no hassle! Our product also bends, forms into different shapes, and can be used in different placement after washing! Saving you both time and effort as it is top of the line product! SIZE AND DIMENSIONS MAKE IT EASY TO FORM TO ANYTHING! Our product can be cut and shaped into any sizes and designs you'd like! These shelf liners can also be cut ahead of time in the most popular pre-cut sizes for easy installation. For different types of sizes and shapes, you can simply trim the liner with regular scissors you can buy at any hardware store. Simply place the liner in your desired area, and then trim off any excess material. MULTI-PURPOSE AND NON-SLIP! You can use our shelf liners basically anywhere in your home! Whether it's in your kitchen drawers, shelves, cabinets, table tops, dining area, countertops, pantry, office space, or laundry room. These shelf liners are the perfect fit! Additionally, the EVA material will help keep off any dust, dirt, or debris that usually accumulates with other products. These shelf liners are easily washable, reusable, sturdy, durable, and most importantly save your time! U.S.A. Design and Testing: While our products are manufactured overseas (let's be honest, what isn't these days.) ALL our DESIGN AND TESTING was done right here in the United States. Your satisfaction is our #1 priority.U.S.A. Design and Testing: While our products are manufactured overseas (let's be honest, what isn't these days.) ALL our DESIGN AND TESTING was done right here in the United States. Your satisfaction is our #1 priority.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BnSU7+6AL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S SUKIHAR","source_asin":"B083HQMS77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083HQMS77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083HQMS77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":283642,"name":"Brazilian Good Luck Wish Bracelets from Salvador Brazil (10x and 12x fitas)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SemLduCxS._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"* For Delivery Time: Expect 1-2 Business Days for Handing and 3-4 Business Days for USPS First Class Mail* This is a set of 10 multicolor wish bands from Salvador Brazil, which I came across while traveling the country and on a tour of the region. Wish bands are nearly everywhere in Northeastern Brazil: People wear them on their wrists; taxis, buses, and other drivers hang them from the rearview mirror; and they are also often tied to balconies, light posts, or other areas around the house, and they provide striking color around the city. Legend has it that Senhor do Bonfim (Lord of the Good End) grants wishes to those who wear bracelets. Recorded along each of the colored bands is a slogan, \"Lembrança do Senhor do Bonfim da Bahia\" which translates to \"Remembrance of the lord of Good End, savior of Bahia.\" Wish bracelets are said to offer good luck and ward off evil. Wearing a wish bracelet is simple: Have a friend wrap the ribbon at the wrist. Tie three knots and make a wish with knot. You want to keep the bracelet on until it falls off naturally. In Salvador, these bands are also frequently tied to rear-view mirrors, hung on balcony railings, or otherwise attached to various fixtures and monuments. The colors include one of each: Orange (Joy and Enthusiasm), Yellow (Success and Intelligence), Dark Green (Money and Growth), Turquoise (Love and Peace), Dark Blue (Health and fertility), Red (Strength and Passion), Hot Pink (Friendship), White (Wisdom and Inner Peace), Purple (Spirituality), and Light Green (Life and Renewal).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SemLduCxS._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OmamoriCharms","source_asin":"B095JJS18Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283642","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095JJS18Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095JJS18Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
