window.products.push({"id":283651,"name":"Capsiplex Pre strongest/hottest Diet and Weight Loss/slim(1 Month Supply)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21lrX0SDSbL._AC_.jpg","description":"Discover how Capsiplex is so Effective Capsiplex is a patented blend of natural ingredients Capsicum Extract, Caffeine, Piperine (Black pepper Extract) and Niacin. Capsiplex uses a proprietary patented matrix of excipients and coatings, to give you the maximum effectiveness of capsaicinoids without experiencing any oral or gastric irritation. The below diagram shows how the tablet is formed which is the secret behind its effectiveness. Capsiplex beadlet design Effective weight loss is achieved by the area around the inert central core of the capsule being packed with high strength capsicum extract which is the secret ingredient to its success. The unique outer coating has been designed to endure the low PH level of the stomach which then releases the capsicum extract in higher PH levels of the intestine to then take effect. Due to this design you will not experience any discomfort when using Capsiplex. Best of all there are no known side effects. Ingredients Capsicum Extract Capsicum extract is the key ingredient in Capsiplex. It aids weight loss byreducing your appetite and increasing your metabolism, it can also help you to burn more calories while you exercise. Caffeine Caffeine is a great addition to Capsiplex as it has a natural ability to increase your energy, alertness and concentration. Piperine Piperine helps the body to absorb more of the nutrients that you ingest. This allows the Capsicum Extract to get to work quicker. Niacin Niacin is also known as Vitamin B3, this helps the body to release energy from carbohydrates, proteins and fats more efficiently. Dosage Take 1 Capsiplex capsule per day with water. Important information It is advised not to take Capsiplex if you are pregnant. If you are taking other medication please consult your doctor before taking the supplement. It is important to note that Capsiplex is a weight loss supplement designed to be taken in conjunction with a healthy diet and exercise regime for best results. The supp","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21lrX0SDSbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CA","source_asin":"B018IUOLSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283651","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018IUOLSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018IUOLSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
