window.products.push({"id":283720,"name":"SVAVO 12oz Glass Soap Dispenser, Kitchen Soap Dispenser with 304 Rust Proof Stainless Steel Pump, Bathroom Soap Dispenser for Hand Soap, Dish, Lotion ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nSSJObXIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ [PREMIUM BATHROOM SOAP DISPENSER] This soap dispenser employs a 304 stainless steel pump and sturdy & thick glass, heavy-duty, durable, and reusable. With rust proof pump head, the dish soap dispenser allows you to keep it long-lasting bright, and not easy to corrode. ✔ [UPGRADED SOAP DISPENSER] The updated version soap dispenser takes on a gradient color to its geometric main body, making it eye-catching in your daily life. Equipped with a tunnel, it enables you to refill your glass soap dispenser easily and conveniently. Buy it with confidence, you'll be provided with a 90-day money-back guarantee and a 3-year warranty. ✔ [FUNCTIONAL AND AESTHETICAL HAND SOAP DISPENSER] SVAVO sleek-looking hand soap dispenser embodies functional and aesthetical characteristics. Easy to press, durable and functional, this soap dispenser can be used as a kitchen soap dispenser or as a bathroom soap dispenser, as a farmhouse style, and as functional bathroom decor. The glass soap dispenser, being perceived as home decoration, keeps your house neat, organized, and stylish as well. ✔ [NO-LEAKING SOAP PUMP]This stainless steel pump of this soap dispenser empowers you to get the desired amount of soap with one pump while no leaks or drips come out. These features will help you save costs and keep your countertop messy-free. The dimensions of the glass soap dispenser come to 6.92\"x2.91\", 12fl.oz capacity. ✔ [GREAT GIFT IDEA] Ideal for detergent, dish, shampoo, hand soap, liquid soap, lotion soap, hand sanitizers, and essential oil, etc. The reusable countertop soap dispenser can be utilized as a bathroom soap dispenser, a kitchen soap dispenser, meanwhile, as an elegant home decor deriving from its geometric and gemstone-like glass body, which contributes to being a great gift for your mom, family, close friends, and colleagues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nSSJObXIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SVAVO","source_asin":"B0B565L4JT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B565L4JT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B565L4JT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
