window.products.push({"id":283742,"name":"Jokari 3-Piece Essential Bottled Beverage Gadget Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vHLaZLrFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The whole purpose of buying that giant bottle of soda is to save money, right? But everyone knows that, more often than not, you end up having to pour out half the bottle because it's gone flat. Jokari's 3-piece bottled beverage gadget set is the perfect way to win the battle of the bubbles. The set includes the highly rated Fizz-Keeper Pump Cap which fits all standard 1, 1.5 and 2 liter bottles; simply replace the bottle's plastic cap with the Fizz-Keeper and pump to preserve fizz. Also included is a Fizz-Keeper Pump & Pour, a clever little device that screws onto the neck of a standard 1, 1.5 or 2 liter plastic bottle and replaces the cap. By squeezing the bulb at the top until the sides of the bottle no longer compress it creates an airtight seal that will maintain the soda's carbonation. The set is completed by a Soda Dispenser that also screws onto standard 1, 1.5 and 2 liter bottle and replaces the cap. After the first pour, simply shake the bottle and dispense with a push of a button. Imagine that . Jokari's 3-piece beverage gadget set could keep up to 3 different bottles of soda fizzy-fresh at the same time! For over 40 years, Jokari has held a special place in its heart for gadgets; today, they specialize in providing affordable solutions to common problems faced by consumers. From unique kitchen gadgets and household storage and organization solutions to their Healthy Steps kitchen tools designed to help with portion control and healthy eating, Jokari is committed to creating useful and often crazy looking \"thingamajigs\" that are fun, functional and easy to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vHLaZLrFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jokari","source_asin":"B00INNXM56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00INNXM56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00INNXM56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
