window.products.push({"id":283749,"name":"ELKCIP Artificial Eucalyptus Garland with Flowers 6FT, Wedding Table Willow Leaf Peony Rose Garland Mantle Decor Dinner Centerpieces for Reception Arc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uItW8EsvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT SIZE - Artificial eucalyptus flower garland is 6 feet long, 13.75 inches wide and 3.5 inches high (when fully stretched), our garland is different from others on the market, we use a wider eucalyptus garland with a larger number and variety of flowers. The realistic and natural flowers blend perfectly with the eucalyptus willow leaves and help create an elegant style/fall/romantic wedding. HIGH QUALITY MATERIAL - This garland is made through a multi-step process with high quality silk leaves and foam flowers, creating a different fullness of layers and romance, perfect for your wedding party. They are carefully packaged in a beautiful box for maximum protection from damage in transit. WIDELY USED FOR WEDDING AND HOME DECORATION - This handmade artificial garland is perfect for wedding decoration, eucalyptus willow garland is widely used as wedding decorations and green decorations for engagement parties. For example, it decorates wedding tables, arches, wedding backdrops, table banners, wreaths, etc. Of course, it is also perfect for everyday use and can be used to decorate mirrors, balconies, fireplaces, windows, stairs, aisles, dining rooms, offices, and gardens. LONG-TERM STORAGE - Our artificial flower vines are very durable and do not require special care. They stay brighter and more beautiful than fresh bouquets and can be stored for a long time, organized in a box after use and reused if there are wedding or party decorations. A great alternative to expensive fresh flowers and greenery. A great way to save money. WARM TIPS - These silk flowers are handmade, please understand that the size may vary slightly and there may be slight color differences between different dye batches. Due to shipping and packaging, the petals and leaves may be a little bent when you receive them, you can adjust them to the shape you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uItW8EsvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELKCIP","source_asin":"B0B5WQJVCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283749","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WQJVCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WQJVCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
