window.products.push({"id":283861,"name":"Vanyear Contact Paper Self Adhesive Shelf Liner Table Door Sticker 17.7 Inch by 9.8 Feet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rPbs18NsL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Instruction For Use:1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, board, wood cabinet,drawer,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature.2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water.3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter.4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth.5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out. This multi-purpose contact paper can protect the furniture from humidity and dirt efficiently.A adorable furniture accessories for your daily home life.Wide:45cm/17.7inchLength: 3M/9.8feetPlease allow 3~7cm deviation as they are manual cutting. If you buy more than two items, we may package your order into ONE ROLLwith the toal length you ordered together in one parcel. Material: PVCPackage Included: One RollNote:1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only.2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface. Hope you can understandQ&AQuestion: When removing it, will it peel off the paint underneath?Answer: No it will not. It comes off clean. (By Amazon Customer)Question: is this item hard to remove? will it leave a residue?Answer: No it's not hard to remove it peals right off no residue,it's beautiful on my wall and all my family and friends love it too.hope this helps you. (By Amazon Customer)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rPbs18NsL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vanyear","source_asin":"B07GCHNCPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GCHNCPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GCHNCPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
