window.products.push({"id":283938,"name":"Mandoline Slicer Vegetable Chopper Multi Function Potato Slicer + Peelers Cutter for Cucumber, Onion, Cheese with 6 Stainless Steel Blades - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6185hnJFARL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"We use this product to cut anything from tomatoes and cucumbers to cheese, apples, and kiwi. It's a great Mandoline Slicer and cuts cooking time in half! It makes it easy to prep food in bulk, and with the storage bin right underneath, it's not messy, which is a plus when it comes time for cleanup. Highly recommend this product for anyone and everyone.one and everyone. This Vegetable slicer has 6 different blades to make all sorts of different cuts. You can slice, cut, grate, & julienne. All your veggies are contained in the large bowl, so you have very little to no mess. Clean up is also very easy because everything is machine washable. The safety handle makes this the perfect tool, along with the no slip handle and base. This is a great addition to any kitchen!!Mandoline Slicer. This makes life so much easier. YOU used it to make homemade potato chips which need to be very thin. adjusted the size to almost as thin as it could get. It was so easy to use and was done in just a few minutes. There are so many different options though with the different blades and the thick or thin options. It didn’t make a mess, and it was so easy to wash! I just rinsed off all the pieces with hot water and towel dried it. This would make a really great gift for anybody who enjoys cooking. Mandoline Slicer A MUST-HAVE KITCHEN ACCESSORY FOR EVERY HOUSEHOLD! It doesn’t matter whether you are a veteran in the kitchen, or if you simple and easy recipes; this premium veggie chopper should not be missing from your cabinets or kitchen counter, since it makes mincing, slicing, dicing, and grating vegetables a fun and easy game! This is a great Mandoline Slicer. I like it better than my food processor. It is a great value because it's sturdy and stable and when I slice food items with it, they saIL thru the blade effortlessly. The food holder works well and is essential to not slicing your fingers off because the blades are sharp! I have used the glove more for other cutting duties and I feel very protected by it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6185hnJFARL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QQKO","source_asin":"B077R9V5FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077R9V5FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077R9V5FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
