window.products.push({"id":283960,"name":"Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container (Set of 6) - BONUS Measuring Cup - Labels & Marker - Durable Plastic - BPA Free - Clear with Improved Lids (Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rFIwzcu7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Your Kitchen Organized And Food Fresh : The Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container set is the perfect solution for keeping your kitchen organized and your food fresh. This set includes 6 containers of the same size (6 cups / 1.2L), making it easy to store and access your food items without having to worry about finding the right size container. The airtight design helps to preserve the freshness of your food, while the transparent design makes it easy to see what's inside. Simplify Your Kitchen & Keep Food Fresh : Shazo Airtight Food Containers: This set of 6 containers (6 cups/1.2L) is perfect for organizing and keeping your food fresh. The airtight design preserves the food's freshness while the transparent body lets you see the contents easily. You won't have to worry about matching lid to container as one lid fits all. Ideal for flour, sugar, pasta, snacks, and more. Get organized and keep your kitchen efficient with the Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container. Organize & Simplify Your Kitchen : The Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container set is a versatile & practical solution for kitchen storage. Not only can these containers be used for storing dry food items like flour and sugar, also suitable for holding liquids like water, juice, & soup. The containers are designed with easy pouring corners to minimize spills, great choice for storing a variety of food. Airtight lids to keep food fresh and a transparent design for easy identification of contents. Maximize Food Freshness & Organization : Elevate your pantry organization with the Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container set. These containers are designed to keep your food fresh for longer, with a secure sealing system that creates an airtight seal with a simple push of the ring on the lid. The ring also doubles as a handle for easy lifting. The containers are stackable and have a modular design, saving valuable space in your pantry. Includes Labels & Marker : Easily identify and organize your food with the Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container set. Each set comes with labels and a marker, allowing you to label your containers and keep track of contents. The labels are made of strong and durable vinyl with a matte texture and uniform shape, giving them an appealing look. And, with the included marker, you'll have everything you need to keep your containers labeled and organized. Enhance Your Cooking Experience With The Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container Set & Ultimate Measuring Cup: Upgrade Your Kitchen with the Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container Set, Now with the Ultimate Measuring Cup Included! With the ability to store both dry and wet food items, and the added convenience of an airtight seal, the Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container set is a must-have for anyone looking to improve their kitchen organization. Say Goodbye To Cluttered Pantries And Hello To An Organized And Efficient Kitchen : with these storage containers. They are also refrigerator safe, reusable, and self-adhesive, making them a convenient solution for your kitchen organization needs. These containers are ideal for organizing all of your favorite food items, from flour & sugar to pasta, snacks, and more. Whether you're looking to simplify your kitchen or just want to keep your food items fresh & accessible. Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container Set Is A Must-have For Any Home : Keep your food fresher for longer with the airtight sealing system of these containers and take the first step towards a more organized kitchen. The Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container set features a secure sealing system, with a ring on the lid that when pushed down expands a silicone seal inside to create an airtight seal. The ring can then be popped back up to serve as a handle for lifting the lid. The Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container Set : is a perfect modular set designed to provide a convenient and organized way to store food. The containers are airtight and help to preserve the freshness of food while making access and food preparation easy. The set includes 6 containers of the same size (6 cups / 1.2L) so you won't have to worry about trying to fit your food into smaller containers. The containers are efficient and ideal for storing your favorite food items safely. The Shazo Airtight Food Storage Container Set : is versatile and can be used for storing both dry food and liquids. The containers are suitable for holding water, juice, soup, and other liquids, and their corners are designed for easy pouring to minimize spills. This makes them a great option for storing a variety of food items, both dry and wet, in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rFIwzcu7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shazo","source_asin":"B09ZFXTXLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZFXTXLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZFXTXLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
