window.products.push({"id":283994,"name":"Precious Moments \"I Feel The Need for Speed Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zuw0KKBcL._AC_SL1229_.jpg","description":"A new mini collection from Precious Moments - Moments Remembered (TM). Bring back those fun-filled days with memories of summer days peddling away on your tricycle! With pigtails flying, this little girl is ready to race on her shiny red tricycle. Porcelain bisque figurine 3.75\" high.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zuw0KKBcL._AC_SL1229_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Precious Moments","source_asin":"B001WAKL2E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001WAKL2E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001WAKL2E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":283995,"name":"Kardharma Arata Zafu Large Round Meditation Floor Cushion | Organic Buckwheat Hull Filled (Adjustable to Posture) | Plum Handle Strap | Easy-to-Wash P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xFsIVY6EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Kardharma Arata is the first zafu meditation cushion designed for yoga, zazen, vipassana, dhyana, and guided meditations. Each Arata cushion is meticulously crafted: 100% cotton, pure white, and filled with organic buckwheat hulls. Arata: A New Journey The Arata (Japanese \"新\" for new) represents each day as a new beginning. Your past doesn’t dictate whom you’re going to be. Adjustable Buckwheat Hulls Natural buckwheat hulls were selected to be the filling inside the Arata rather than foam or cotton found in other typical cushions. Buckwheat hulls are sturdy and do not retain heat, making them an ideal allergy-free alternative to synthetic fiber fills. In our tests, the buckwheat hulls provided better support than foam, cotton, and feathers. The buckwheat hulls make the cushion sort of like a big hacky sack. You can easily scoop out the hulls into a container until the cushion feels just right. Pure White Easy-to-Wash Cotton Cover The Arata’s outer cover is constructed with 12-ounce high-quality cotton. To clean, simply unzip the outer shell and cold wash with other whites. Air dry to prevent shrinkage. Plum Carrying Strap Typical carrying handles use the same cotton material used in the outer cover. Not the Arata. The Arata uses the signature plum carrying strap with reinforced fibers designed to handle everyday transport. Kardharma One (1) Year Limited Warranty Kardharma warranties this product to be free from defects in materials and workmanship for a period of one (1) year following the date of purchase, provided that the product is used in a home environment. This limited warranty does not apply to products which are (i) repaired, modified or altered; (ii) used in conjunction with equipment not provided or authorized by Kardharma; or (iii) subjected to unusual physical and thermal conditions, misuse, abuse, accident or negligence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xFsIVY6EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kardharma","source_asin":"B07CLKZTK8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-283995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CLKZTK8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CLKZTK8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
